  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Refugee Charcoal Project in Goma - North Kivu, DRC</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project will provide alternatives to refugees and the host communities alongside Virunga National Parc in order to reduce de current deforestation of the Parc, On top of that this project will explore other livelihood options and develop talents and skills of refugees and the host communities. This project seeks also to change the image of refugees and make them reliable actors in the development.</narrative>
  </description>
